GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org), licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

The data has been modified: filtered to populated places in Canada, the United
States, Mexico and the United Kingdom, and reduced to name, coordinates,
country, region, population and time zone (scripts/build_places.py).

